#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:16
msgid "This document will introduce you to the SeExpr expression language."
msgstr "Ta dokument vas bo predstavil jeziku izrazov SeExpr."

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:20
msgid "What is SeExpr?"
msgstr "Kaj je SeExpr?"

#: ../../tutorials/seexpr.rst:22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"SeExpr is an embeddable expression language, designed by Disney Animation, "
"that allows host applications to render dynamically generated content. Pixar "
"calls it `in its documentation <https://renderman.pixar.com/resources/"
"RenderMan_20/PxrSeExpr.html>`_ a \"scriptable pattern generator and combiner"
"\"."
msgstr ""
"SeExpr je vdelani izrazni jezik, ki ga je zasnoval Disney Animation, ki "
"aplikacijam gostiteljev omogoča dinamično ustvarjeno vsebino. Pixar ga "
"imenuje \"v svoji dokumentaciji <https://renderman.pixar.com/resources/"
"RenderMan_20/PxrSeExpr.html>\"_ \"skriptni generator vzorcev in kombiniralnik"
"\"."

